{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05875","headline":"晦日游大理韦卿城南别业四声依次用各六韵 四 · 王维","name":"晦日游大理韦卿城南别业四声依次用各六韵 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高馆临澄陂，旷然荡心目。\n淡荡动云天，玲珑映墟曲。\n鹊巢结空林，雉雊响幽谷。\n应接无闲暇，徘徊以踯躅。\n纡组上春堤，侧弁倚乔木。\n弦望忽已晦，後期洲应绿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}